{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1421305-aberrant-what-would-be-the-minumum-requirements-for-a-nova-that-wants-to-be-a-space-traveller","id":1421305,"title":"[Aberrant] What would be the minumum requirements for a nova that wants to be a space traveller?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-01T09:51:43-08:00","id":1421305,"title":"[Aberrant] What would be the minumum requirements for a nova that wants to be a space traveller?","content":"For aberrant, im thinking of a Nova with the ability to travel unaided trough space and wanders from one Star System to the next. Visiting new planets and civilizations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T12:03:22-08:00","id":1421323,"title":"","content":"The fastest a Nova with the ability to travel unaided through space can go is the speed of light. So, it's going to take a Nova 4 years to get to the nearest solar system. If you really want to go exploring, you should pick up Remote Sensing and Teleport with the Interplanetary range. That would get you to any other planet in the galaxy in 5 hours at the minimum Quantum required.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T12:19:01-08:00","id":1421325,"title":"","content":"Also, it would be better to have Adaptation that allows you to live from Quantum for a while, so you don\u2019t need to take food, air and water to space (or even a space suit).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T12:59:52-08:00","id":1421329,"title":"","content":"Adaptation is enough to survive hostile environments?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T17:06:42-08:00","id":1421360,"title":"","content":"As long as they have a point of Quantum left.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T22:14:26-08:00","id":1421393,"title":"","content":"Am i understanding right that you only need Warp 1 and Teleport 2 for interstellar travel?<br /> Also, just Mega-Intellect 1 is enough to not get lost in space?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1351,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","user":"Sakii","date":". 11-02-2020, 10:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T00:48:19-08:00","id":1421401,"title":"","content":"With Warp/Teleport you don\u2019t get lost, as you need only to know where you need to go to get there, but yes, Warp was created to space travel basically, Teleport not that much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T05:21:19-08:00","id":1421419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1421305-aberrant-what-would-be-the-minumum-requirements-for-a-nova-that-wants-to-be-a-space-traveller?p=1421401#post1421401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Warp/Teleport you don\u2019t get lost, as you need only to know where you need to go to get there, but yes, Warp was created to space travel basically, Teleport not that much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Teleport is fine if you're going by yourself. You need Warp to bring others with you, unless you have the Bestow or Impose tag on Teleport. They take the same amount of time from a 3rd party perspective. However, Teleport feels instantaneous to the person/people using it, and Warp feels like hours of travel in a glowing tube.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T07:04:05-08:00","id":1421433,"title":"","content":"I was thinking about it in game design perspective. Warp has a infinite range by default, while teleport don\u2019t. Warp basically was created by the team to allow \u201cinstant\u201d travel, not a tactical use, while teleport is tactical but can be used to travel too if trained to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T07:18:46-08:00","id":1421438,"title":"","content":"The fact that they imposed a time to travel element just to allow Aeon to work as is bothers me to no end. Especially considering to me the idea of Warp is either the stargate (nearly instant travel) or something like a tear in space that leads a single step to let one go from here to there. So yeah, there is no time in travel for me.<br /> <br /> Also if this is a full on space focused game then the rules in the book have some potential adjustments to make it a bit easier. One of which is that it Adaptation just works, no need to spend quantum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 11-02-2020, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T07:47:11-08:00","id":1421446,"title":"","content":"The time for traveling is imposed to Psions too, but it\u2019s not a big deal, just ignore it.<br /> <br /> I personally like the idea of a Hyper Drive like travel times for Nivas, while Psions could travel almost instantaneously, but it\u2019s a personal preference to be honest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-03T08:02:07-08:00","id":1421624,"title":"","content":"Yes, my idea is a game where people do interstellar travel, but then also travel in space between planets sometimes.<br /> I just find it awesome that the first one or two dots of a power are, go to the next solar system, for funsies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}